<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-OTC TRADE 641,515 LATS IN LAST WEEK OF MAY.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-OTC TRADE 641,515 LATS IN LAST WEEK OF MAY.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Over-the-counter market turnover in the last week of May came to 641,515 lats against 408,673 lats on the bourse, the Riga stock exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>The most active trade outside the bourse in the week of May 26 to May 30 took place in Valmiera Glassfibre which turned over 213,372 lats, followed by Unibanka at 133,975 lats and Riga Shipyard at 129,519 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
